msgstr "此页面的打开地址与 APP_URL 不同"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/components/app_url_warning.html:19
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The URLs below are built from the APP_URL setting, "
"<code>%(app_url)s</code>, but this page was opened at "
"<code>%(host)s</code>. If that is the address others use to reach "
"Specivo, set APP_URL to it, or the URLs you copy may not reach this "
"instance."
msgstr ""
"下方的 URL 由 APP_URL 设置 <code>%(app_url)s</code> 生成，但此页面是在 "
"<code>%(host)s</code> 打开的。如果其他人通过该地址访问 Specivo，请将 APP_URL 设为该地址，否则复制的 URL"
" 可能无法访问此实例。"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/components/app_url_warning.html:21
