#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/admin/user_detail.html:319
msgid ""
"Replace <code>your-specivo-host</code> with this instance's hostname (use"
" <code>http://</code> for local development, <code>https://</code> in "
"production) and <code>spv_your_api_key_here</code> with an API key "
"created above. The agent connects to Specivo over HTTP — no database "
"access or local installation required."
msgstr ""
"请将 <code>your-specivo-host</code> 替换为此实例的主机名（本地开发使用 "
"<code>http://</code>，生产环境使用 <code>https://</code>），并将 "
"<code>spv_your_api_key_here</code> 替换为上方创建的 API 密钥。代理通过 HTTP 连接到 Specivo "
"—— 无需访问数据库或在本地安装。"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/admin/user_detail.html:322
msgid ""
"Codex CLI reads MCP servers from <code>~/.codex/config.toml</code> and "
"speaks Streamable HTTP natively. Replace <code>your-specivo-host</code> "
"with this instance's hostname, then export your API key in the shell: "
"<code>export SPECIVO_API_KEY=spv_your_api_key_here</code>. Codex will "
"read it via <code>bearer_token_env_var</code> and send "
"<code>Authorization: Bearer &lt;key&gt;</code> on every request — no "
"<code>mcp-remote</code> bridge needed."
msgstr ""
"Codex CLI 从 <code>~/.codex/config.toml</code> 读取 MCP 服务器配置，并原生支持 "
"Streamable HTTP。请将 <code>your-specivo-host</code> 替换为此实例的主机名，然后在 shell "
"中导出你的 API 密钥：<code>export "
"SPECIVO_API_KEY=spv_your_api_key_here</code>。Codex 会通过 "
"<code>bearer_token_env_var</code> 读取它，并在每次请求时发送 <code>Authorization: "
"Bearer &lt;key&gt;</code> —— 无需 <code>mcp-remote</code> 桥接。"

