msgstr "默认关闭：这样接收方永远不会得知私有内容。"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1247
msgid ""
"Private issues and private notes are not sent. Only an administrator can "
"change that."
msgstr "私有工作项和私有备注不会被发送。只有管理员可以更改此设置。"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1251
